# Job Applications

All application files live under `Job Applications/` at the repo root.

Layout:

- `Job Applications/companies/{Company}/` — one folder per company
- `Job Applications/General Application Info/` — reusable form answers (`reference.md`), not a company
- `Job Applications/_template/Job.md`, `INDEX.md`, `_archive/`

`General Application Info` is not listed in `INDEX.md`.

Each company folder under `companies/` uses these names:

- `Cody Duke Product Design Resume.pdf`
- `Cody Duke Product Design Cover Letter.pdf`
- `Job.md`

Interview notes, offer notes, follow-ups, and research go in that same company folder. Use `Interviews.md` and `Offer.md` when those exist. Do not start a new root folder for a company that already has one.

New applications get `Job Applications/companies/{Company}/`, the two PDFs, and a `Job.md` copied from `_template/Job.md`. Update `INDEX.md`.
